Data race on `CollectorManager::group()` — unsynchronized unordered_map lookup from hot path. Add mutable member to cache the Event:

```suggestion:-0+7
    beast::insight::Event
    executionTimeEvent(std::string_view name) const override
    {
        if (!cachedEvent_)
            cachedEvent_ = ctx_.registry.get()
                .getCollectorManager()
                .group("finish_time")
                ->makeEvent("finish_time");
        return *cachedEvent_;
    }
```

